  "definition": "Plan and Report Required for All Mitigation Proposals",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-10-13",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wt 803) #11000, eff 2-1-16; ss by #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800); ss by #13774, eff 10-13-23",
